    "A larger buffer keeps more recent Activity history in memory for Preview & Copy. Lower values use less memory but trim older log lines sooner." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A larger buffer keeps more recent Activity history in memory for Preview & Copy. Lower values use less memory but trim older log lines sooner."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein größerer Puffer hält mehr aktuelle Aktivitäten für „Vorschau & Kopieren“ im Speicher. Kleinere Werte benötigen weniger Speicher, kürzen ältere Protokollzeilen aber früher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A larger buffer keeps more recent console history in memory for the Run workspace. Lower values use less memory but trim older log lines sooner." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the log buffer.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein größerer Puffer behält mehr aktuelle Konsolenverläufe für den Ausführungsbereich im Speicher. Niedrigere Werte sparen Arbeitsspeicher, kürzen ältere Log-Zeilen jedoch früher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A preview copies nothing. It shows exactly what would happen." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A preview copies nothing. It shows exactly what would happen."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Vorschau kopiert nichts. Sie zeigt genau, was passieren würde."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A preview copies nothing. It shows where each file would go, which are exact copies, and any problems." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A preview copies nothing. It shows where each file would go, which are exact copies, and any problems."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Vorschau kopiert nichts. Sie zeigt das Ziel jeder Datei, identische Kopien und mögliche Probleme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A preview copies nothing. It shows where every file would go, and you decide after that." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A preview copies nothing. It shows where every file would go, and you decide after that."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Vorschau kopiert nichts. Sie zeigt das Ziel jeder Datei. Danach entscheidest du."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A preview copies nothing. It shows where every photo and video would go, so you can check before copying." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A preview copies nothing. It shows where every photo and video would go, so you can check before copying."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Vorschau kopiert nichts. Sie zeigt das Ziel jedes Fotos und Videos, damit du vor dem Kopieren alles prüfen kannst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A preview couldn't be made for this file." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A preview couldn't be made for this file."
