    "Verification re-checks each copied file after it is copied. It adds work, but it provides stronger confidence that destination files match the originals." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verification re-checks each copied file after it is copied. It adds work, but it provides stronger confidence that destination files match the originals."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Überprüfung prüft jede kopierte Datei nach dem Kopieren erneut. Das erfordert zusätzlichen Aufwand, gibt aber mehr Sicherheit, dass die Zieldateien den Originalen entsprechen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verification re-hashes copied files after transfer. It adds work, but it provides stronger confidence that destination files match the originals." : {
