          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chronoframe could not read its trial records, so it cannot confirm how much of the free allowance is left. Purchasing the unlock removes the limit entirely. Details: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
