          }
        }
      }
    },
    "None of the files in that batch are still where they were when you confirmed it, so nothing was copied. Your originals were left untouched. Run a preview to see what is there now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keine der Dateien dieses Testlaufs befindet sich noch dort, wo sie bei deiner Bestätigung war. Deshalb wurde nichts kopiert. Deine Originale blieben unangetastet. Erstelle eine Vorschau, um den aktuellen Stand zu sehen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some files couldn't be read" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Einige Dateien konnten nicht gelesen werden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chronoframe could not read %lld source file(s), so nothing was copied. Originals were left untouched; check file access and try again." : {
